00:00:01.599 --> 00:00:03.750 align:start position:0%
 
the realm  do you know what the realm is  it's the thousand blades of aegon's  enemies  a story we agreed to tell each other  over  and over till we forget that it's a lie  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another game of thrones and  house of the dragon update video well my  friends it looks like there is some  shocking news in regards to the game of  thrones veteran director and house of  the dragon showrunner miguel sapochnick  according to a brand new article  released only yesterday there is a  massive shakeup within house of the  dragon as one of its showrunners walks  away from the hit series now for those  of you who might not know miguel is best  known for his work on game of thrones as  the director of some of its greatest  episodes like heart home battle of the  bastards and the winds of winter after  having such massive success on game of  thrones hbo brought him on to work on  their new series house of the dragon as  one of the show runners alongside ryan  condole he also directed house of the  dragon's first episode as well as a few  others that will be released later this  season unfortunately it looks like he  will be stepping down as house of the  dragon showrunner according to the new  article sources say miguel is leaving  the show after an exhausting three years  of work went into the game of thrones  series how so the dragon co-creator ryan  condell will now serve as the show's  head showrunner and continue to work  with co-creator george rr martin it says  that miguel has also entered into a  first look deal with hbo to develop  other shows and he will remain as  executive producer for the duration of  the series i really hope this means  miguel will still direct at least one  episode in the final season ever since i  heard miguel would be working on house  of the dragon i was really hoping he  would be the one who directed the  episode that will feature an incredible  dragon battle over the god's eye now i  won't go into exactly what that means in  case some of you don't want to know but  if you've read fire and blood you know  exactly what i mean and you know that  episode will most likely be one of the  greatest episodes in all of the game of  thrones in house of the dragon i thought  miguel was exactly who he would need for  that episode because he's always been  known for directing some of game of  thrones greatest battles i'm guessing  making this show must be a lot harder  than any of us have imagined i know it  wasn't easy for him to walk away from a  series that will most likely be one of  the biggest shows within the next few  years now the good news is hbo has hired  another game of thrones veteran to fill  his spot on house of the dragon alan  taylor who also directed many game of  thrones episodes will now step in to  direct several episodes during house of  the dragon's second season for those of  you who don't know allen actually  directed nearly half of game of thrones  second season which if you ask me is one  of the better seasons of the show he  also directed one of my favorite  episodes baylor when ned stark was  executed in the first season when he  gave a statement about joining house of  the dragon he said it's an honor to be  back at hbo immersing myself into the  world of the targaryens ryan miguel and  george have created an extraordinary  story in a rich and fascinating world  going back to westeros will be a massive  undertaking and i'm looking forward to  the challenge well alan all i can say is  welcome back to westeros i hope you're  able to bring back some of the magic you  brought to game of thrones now i think i  speak for most fans when i say those  were some of the best years on the show  it is sad that miguel is leaving house  of the dragon anyone who has been  watching my videos over the last few  years knows exactly how excited i was  when it was announced that he would be  joining the show although he is leaving  i do look forward to seeing the other  episodes he did direct for this season  hopefully the door will still be open  for him in the future if he eventually  does decide he would like to direct  another episode for house of the dragon  again  as always let me know what you think  about this new information do any of you  think this will negatively affect the  show leave me your thoughts down below i  want to thank all of you for stopping by  and watching the short update video i  hope you all have a great day i will see  you again very soon  bye  [Music]  [Music]  you

